Markovian engine conformance runner
===================================

runner.ts in this directory is the official Markovian engine conformance suite
from the Meterless project:

  Source:  https://github.com/Meterless/Meterless
  Path:    engines/markovian/conformance/runner.ts
  Commit:  1742dec56a66e58eef9dda2d2b865823758ca8cd
  License: Apache License, Version 2.0 (full text in LICENSE next to this file)
  Copyright 2026 Meterless

The file is vendored unmodified (line endings normalised to LF). It is not part
of Lotline's own code and is excluded from the repo's type-check. Lotline's
implementation under test lives in packages/engines/markovian and is run
against this suite with:

  pnpm conformance:markovian
